  "text": "AFK Rathis\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nPositioning\n⬥ Position yourself in Melee distance to the east of where Rathis Spawns.\n​\nMelee AFK Method (58+ kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\n⬥ Necklace of Salamancy \n⬥ Chaos Roar \n⬥ Elder Overload Salve  or Venomblood \n⬥ Turmoil  and Soul Split \n⬥ Do not activate your book slot\n\nOptional\n⬥ Greater Fury \n⬥ Bonfire lifepoints boost  and Ogre flask (Thermal) \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ You can also use  +  instead of \n​\nPreset Suggestions\n⬥ Melee \n\n​\nAction Bars\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ 5 minute example\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Rathis ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Positioning ⬥ Position yourself in Melee distance to the east of where Rathis Spawns. ​ Melee AFK Method (58+ kph) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel ⬥ Necklace of Salamancy ⬥ Chaos Roar ⬥ Elder Overload Salve or Venomblood ⬥ Turmoil and Soul Split ⬥ Do not activate your book slot Optional ⬥ Greater Fury ⬥ Bonfire lifepoints boost and Ogre flask (Thermal) ⬥ You can also use + instead of ​ Preset Suggestions ⬥ Melee ​ Action Bars ​ Example Kills ⬥ 5 minute example ​",
